  "notes": [
    "Design supports both LDO and DCDC mode (DCDC default for vehicle, R55 NC / L2+R59+C77+C78+C79 populated)",
    "XTAL_OUT (pin 31) must be disabled for EMC compliance",
    "UWB module communicates via LPSPI1 (SPI) with clock sync and GPIO handshake",
    "CAN-FD PHY on page 3, ID0/ID1 for left/right module differentiation",
    "Watchdog: U6 STWD100 or U7 TPS3435 (NC alternate)",
    "HW_VER and Car_Configuration use resistor divider ADC for version detection (11 levels)",
    "VOUT_SWITCH max 40mA, Rdson max 3 ohm - not recommended for external supply",
    "BLE antenna: 2.4GHz with SAW filter (FSSCAN1N2G44H4PEUA) and matching network"
  ],
